sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as QALY UI
  participant API as QALY API
  participant GW as AiGateway
  participant Cache as AI Cache
  participant Quota as Quota/Budget Guard
  participant APIProvider as AI API Provider
  participant Ollama as Ollama Local Provider
  participant Mock as Mock Provider

  UI->>API: Request AI feature
  API->>GW: ExecuteAiUseCase(type, payload, userScope)
  GW->>Cache: Lookup hash(payload+schema+version)
  alt cache hit
    Cache-->>GW: Cached structured output
  else cache miss
    GW->>Quota: Check daily/project budget
    alt budget ok
      GW->>APIProvider: Call primary model with timeout
      alt success
        APIProvider-->>GW: JSON output
      else fail/timeout
        GW->>Ollama: Try local fallback if enabled
        alt local success
          Ollama-->>GW: JSON output
        else local fail
          GW->>Mock: Use deterministic sample if demo/test
          Mock-->>GW: JSON output
        end
      end
    else over budget
      GW->>Mock: Use cached/mock or return quota notice
      Mock-->>GW: JSON output/notice
    end
  end
  GW->>GW: Validate JSON schema + safety rules
  GW-->>API: Draft result + provider_used
  API-->>UI: Show result for user review
